data_corundum_Al2O3
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# alpha-Al2O3 (corundum), hand-built standard structure for the IUCr CPD-1c
# benchmark.  Space group R -3 c (No.167), hexagonal setting.
# Cell a=4.7592 A, c=12.9918 A.  Al on 12c (0,0,0.3521); O on 18e
# (0.3064,0,1/4).  These are the textbook starting values used for a Rietveld
# refinement of the CPD-1c round-robin.
#
# A matching COD entry was not reliably reachable (COD 9003079 turned out to be
# goethite FeHO2), so this CIF was written from scratch per the T10.8 fallback
# recipe.  Symmetry is left to GSAS-II's built-in space-group table (R -3 c),
# which is how the shipped PbSO4-Wyckoff.cif sample also resolves its ops.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_chemical_name_common       'corundum'
_chemical_formula_sum       'Al2 O3'
_cell_length_a              4.7592
_cell_length_b              4.7592
_cell_length_c              12.9918
_cell_angle_alpha           90.0
_cell_angle_beta            90.0
_cell_angle_gamma          120.0
_cell_volume                254.81
_cell_formula_units_Z       6
_symmetry_cell_setting      trigonal
_symmetry_space_group_name_H-M  'R -3 c'
_space_group_IT_number      167
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
_atom_site_U_iso_or_equiv
_atom_site_occupancy
  Al  Al  0.0       0.0       0.3521    0.30   1.0
  O   O   0.3064    0.0       0.25      0.30   1.0
